# 8. TOOL CAPABILITY BOUNDARY

Agent definitions must explicitly declare allowed tools.

Example:

allowedTools:

* calculator

The model must NOT be able to expand this list.

The user must NOT be able to expand this list.

A tool call is valid only if:

Agent Capability
+
Request Authorization
+
AG-004 Tool Policy
+
Tool Schema
+
Agentic Loop Limits

all permit execution.

This creates defense in depth.

