# 15. DUPLICATE REGISTRATION

The registry must prevent unsafe duplicate registration.

Rules:

* same agent ID + same version → deterministic behavior
* same agent ID + incompatible definition → reject
* duplicate registration must not silently overwrite a running agent
* lifecycle state must not unexpectedly reset

Define normalized errors for conflicts.

